Usage: lookout triage <command> [flags]

triage — incident reads: everything abnormal, condensed logs/events, blast radius, what changed

Commands:
  demo  Emit synthetic findings to exercise the §4.2 envelope; test scaffolding only.
  logs  Condense a workload's logs by template fingerprint; kubectl logs, but ~350 tokens.

Run 'lookout triage <command> --help' for flags, output fields, and examples.
